  "published": "2026-07-10T14:51:30.68Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.0.0-alpha.1: prerelease of the 4.0.0 security-hardening line — API may still change before stable. Includes: tenant isolation on admin operations, server-side RBAC scope resolution, invitation acceptance bound to the invited e-mail, JWT security-stamp validation (revocation of issued tokens), anti mass-assignment on tenant/guest updates, forced admin password change on first login, and consumer-supplied secrets enforced at startup. This alpha adds: SystemAdmin-only AssignToTenantAsync (explicit tenant assignment, separate from UpdateAsync), GetTenantAdminIdAsync (tenant admin by real role membership), case-insensitive/trimmed tenant-name matching at login, and the seeded admin now also holds TenantAdmin for the default tenant. BREAKING changes vs v3.x — see UPGRADE.md.",
